; A lot whose units are interpolated is undated, as beancount dates an
; augmentation before interpolation: a reduction naming its transaction's
; date matches no lot, and {} cannot choose between it and a dated lot of
; the same cost. Interpolated negative units augment, as beancount books
; only written units as a reduction.
