  Assets:Stock  1 HOOL {10 USD}
  Assets:Cash   -10.00 USD

2020-01-05 * "Reduce with the interpolated lot's transaction date"
  Assets:Stock  -1 HOOL {10 USD, 2020-01-02}
  Assets:Cash   10.00 USD

2020-01-06 * "Reduce with {}"
  Assets:Stock  -1 HOOL {}
  Assets:Cash   10.00 USD

